# ── Data directory: ignore everything, then re-include Matmul + hilbert ──
OverNet/Data/**
!OverNet/Data/Matmul/
!OverNet/Data/Matmul/**
!OverNet/Data/hilbert/
OverNet/Data/hilbert/data
!OverNet/Data/hilbert/**

# ── But still block binary/model files inside those re-included dirs ────
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.bin
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.pt
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.onnx
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.trt
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.engine
OverNet/Data/Matmul/**/*.data
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.bin
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.pt
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.onnx
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.trt
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.engine
OverNet/Data/hilbert/**/*.data